        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9c516173-928b-3c41-88b1-0c323d305ea4",
                "word": "magnanime",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "00a5cd28-b86b-4db4-9f54-4e0ea1d777de",
                        "entry_id": "9c516173-928b-3c41-88b1-0c323d305ea4",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "magnanimes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6d8de65b-fb6b-3289-9543-533770d53395",
                        "entry_id": "9c516173-928b-3c41-88b1-0c323d305ea4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a de la grandeur, de la force d'âme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d863051f-129c-467a-bc4d-1fd0e86b2eb0",
                                "sense_id": "6d8de65b-fb6b-3289-9543-533770d53395",
                                "text": "Le lion a complètement disparu de la région dont nous nous occupons; mais il joue un grand rôle dans les contes indigènes, qui le représentent comme un animal essentiellement noble et magnanime."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7f5e0084-2d16-3ec3-8061-c85952097cb1",
                        "entry_id": "9c516173-928b-3c41-88b1-0c323d305ea4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a une nature, un caractère ou une personnalité clémente, généreuse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6f1be6b-65f1-4db8-91a4-ed861259fd6e",
                                "sense_id": "7f5e0084-2d16-3ec3-8061-c85952097cb1",
                                "text": "Français, en guerriers magnanimes,\nPortez ou retenez vos coups !\nÉpargnez ces tristes victimes,\nÀ regret s’armant contre nous."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd63c953-d360-4be4-ba84-fffeb780939b",
                                "sense_id": "7f5e0084-2d16-3ec3-8061-c85952097cb1",
                                "text": "L’arme en joue, il avança sur son antagoniste, avec, dans l’esprit, la sotte fantaisie de crier un « haut les mains ! » magnanime. Mais le Prince le vit : […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0286eede-5423-4817-babf-8330b78847bf",
                                "sense_id": "7f5e0084-2d16-3ec3-8061-c85952097cb1",
                                "text": "Toutefois, si un magnanime sentiment de fraternité s’imposait sincèrement et définitivement, sans arrière pensée, à tous les esprits européens, alors nous n’aurions pas à nous inquiéter du cosmopolitisme marseillais, intéressant embryon de la civilisation future."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7f667ceb-3aa9-46dd-8ee7-403298ecfafa",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c516173-928b-3c41-88b1-0c323d305ea4",
                        "target_lang_word": "großmütig",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "großmütig",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00bf22e9-ab76-3512-af04-c9fee50767d8",
                                        "entry_id": "1bf8c4b8-8463-37ef-b1f4-2cb47d644b4d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "voll Selbstvertrauen sein, Großmut besitzen, zeigen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f04f7b1a-5e08-4b85-93ad-270cdb35912e",
                                                "sense_id": "00bf22e9-ab76-3512-af04-c9fee50767d8",
                                                "text": "„dass man sich zu diesem \"großmütigen\" Urteil aufgrund des Alters des Angeklagten entschlossen hätte“ (Bieler, Mädchenkrieg 391)"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31c50823-fcc5-48dc-8c55-25710fc5210c",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c516173-928b-3c41-88b1-0c323d305ea4",
                        "target_lang_word": "magnanimous",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "magnanimous",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79b05f58-2c41-35ba-9e06-c6162eb24497",
                                        "entry_id": "65910ba2-c8af-3843-9a70-33d70b0b228c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Noble and generous in spirit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b05d5e5d-6c29-41d2-b6d0-a53510d0e0e4",
                                                "sense_id": "79b05f58-2c41-35ba-9e06-c6162eb24497",
                                                "text": "She is a theame of honour and renowne, / A ſpurre to valiant and magnanimous deeds, / Whoſe preſent courage may beate downe our foes, / And fame in time to come canonize us, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9703c0fc-0e20-4c1a-a6fc-af7b29051e8e",
                                                "sense_id": "79b05f58-2c41-35ba-9e06-c6162eb24497",
                                                "text": "First, our friendship began at that early time when alone it is unalloyed and sincere; secondly\"—and here, in spite of her vivacity, Marie's voice trembled—\"you are associated with the only being in the world I ever really loved; and thirdly, I have behaved exceedingly ill to you, and, consequently, feel it quite magnanimous not to hate you, which is the established rule on such occasions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c79d1ee7-4a08-424d-8117-fae0a2988b4f",
                                                "sense_id": "79b05f58-2c41-35ba-9e06-c6162eb24497",
                                                "text": "doolittle [sad but magnanimous] They played you off very cunning, Eliza, them two sportsmen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab40494b-bbe3-48e4-9e08-df4e4d7aa575",
                                                "sense_id": "79b05f58-2c41-35ba-9e06-c6162eb24497",
                                                "text": "I felt vaguely he was a sneak, and remained quite unmollified by advances on his side, which, in a boy's barbarous fashion, unless it suited me to be magnanimous, I haughtily ignored."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "85ef53ee-d071-42ff-b1dd-785cbca2d9a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c516173-928b-3c41-88b1-0c323d305ea4",
                        "target_lang_word": "magnánimo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "magnánimo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bbf9b5b-c024-3b8e-9829-e4b67c08254c",
                                        "entry_id": "c212df70-a810-3cbf-adb3-a799460adf4a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que tiene magnanimidad; que posee grandeza de espíritu y actúa noblemente."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba6026db-603e-458d-9e01-9ef94ebabd77",
                                                "sense_id": "8bbf9b5b-c024-3b8e-9829-e4b67c08254c",
                                                "text": "De magnánimos es llevar con mansedumbre los descuidos."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f01570e1-c2c1-45ce-8238-a6d5c4a6950f",
                                                "sense_id": "8bbf9b5b-c024-3b8e-9829-e4b67c08254c",
                                                "text": "el magnánimo entre todas las acciones virtuosas emprende siempre las mas ilustres y heroicas, á las que ciertamente se deben los primeros honores; y por esto se dice, que la magnanimidad hace grandes todas las otras virtudes."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d546509-0a0a-3411-8a56-e44c48abe7dd",
                                        "entry_id": "c212df70-a810-3cbf-adb3-a799460adf4a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que indica o revela magnanimidad."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
